u_854223891d96a560b376;message;exact;Trident head is the pronged end of a trident.;Atraimen kärki on sen piikikäs pää.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_4134699dc96c851cf941;message;exact;Trident head is the pronged end of a trident. Trident head is attached to the spear haft  to assemble a working weapon. There are few different types of trident heads for different types of tridents. See WEAPONS for more information.;Atraimenkärki on atraimen piikikäs pää. Se kiinnitetään keihäänvarteen toimivan aseen kokoamiseksi. Eri atraintyypeille on muutamia erilaisia kärkiä. Lisätietoa: ASEET.;{};{};;;;;m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_0b03a798336fefff2bc6;message;exact;Trident is a triple-pointed spear.;Atrain on kolmipiikkinen keihäs.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_4822d59872d1c206c574;message;exact;Trident is a triple-pointed spear. Trident is commonly used in fishing. When used as a combat weapon it attacks no better (sometimes worse) than a spear, but its three prongs gives it a somewhat better defensive capacity.;Atrain on kolmipiikkinen keihäs, jota käytetään yleisesti kalastukseen. Taistelussa se ei hyökkää tavallista keihästä paremmin, joskus huonomminkin, mutta kolme piikkiä parantavat hieman puolustuskykyä.;{};{};;;;;m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_8f59bfb233324d5ff109;message;exact;True forest robbers are nesting in our vicinity. There they lurk in the woods, sneaking around and robbing lone wanderers - at our lands!;Oikeita metsärosvoja pesii lähistöllä. He vaanivat metsissä, hiiviskelevät ja ryöstävät yksinäisiä kulkijoita, meidän maillamme!;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_8a72cc8e1efa0078b52a;message;exact;Turn 180ø left;Käänny 180ø vasemmalle;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_7d15eff53ed3f0ce6633;message;exact;Turn around and kick a tree with your heel and the squirrel will then stay still in there, even if it would have been jumping around a lot earlier.;Käänny ympäri ja potkaise puuta kantapäälläsi. Orava pysyy silloin puussa paikoillaan, vaikka se olisi aiemmin hyppinyt paljonkin.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_4f369829158428226d29;message;exact;Turnip;nauris;"{""ablative"":""nauriilta"",""ablative_plural"":""nauriilta"",""adessive"":""nauriilla"",""adessive_plural"":""nauriilla"",""allative"":""nauriille"",""allative_plural"":""nauriille"",""elative"":""nauriista"",""elative_plural"":""nauriista"",""essive"":""nauriina"",""essive_plural"":""nauriina"",""few"":""naurista"",""genitive"":""nauriin"",""genitive_plural"":""nauriiden"",""illative"":""nauriiseen"",""illative_plural"":""nauriisiin"",""inessive"":""nauriissa"",""inessive_plural"":""nauriissa"",""many"":""naurista"",""nominative"":""nauris"",""nominative_plural"":""nauriit"",""one"":""nauris"",""other"":""naurista"",""partitive"":""naurista"",""partitive_plural"":""nauriita"",""plural"":""nauriit"",""translative"":""nauriiksi"",""translative_plural"":""nauriiksi""}";{};;;;{};m;"{""ablative"":""m"",""ablative_plural"":""m"",""adessive"":""m"",""adessive_plural"":""m"",""allative"":""m"",""allative_plural"":""m"",""elative"":""m"",""elative_plural"":""m"",""essive"":""m"",""essive_plural"":""m"",""few"":""m"",""genitive"":""m"",""genitive_plural"":""plural"",""illative"":""m"",""illative_plural"":""m"",""inessive"":""m"",""inessive_plural"":""m"",""many"":""m"",""nominative"":""m"",""nominative_plural"":""m"",""one"":""m"",""other"":""m"",""partitive"":""m"",""partitive_plural"":""m"",""plural"":""plural"",""translative"":""m"",""translative_plural"":""m""}";;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_1c753ffc74d74eee4390;message;exact;Turnip is the basic vegetable.;Nauris on perusjuures.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_50183e7ea7e0ebd55049;message;exact;Turnip is the basic vegetable. It is easy to grow, the first ones are ready to be harvested already at mid-summer, and when stored in a cellar they will last the whole winter. Stewing turnips buried in hot embers of a burnt-out fire is a common and probably the most delicious cookery recipe for turnips.;Nauris on tärkein juures. Se on helppo kasvattaa, ensimmäiset ehtivät korjattaviksi jo keskikesällä, ja kellarissa ne säilyvät koko talven. Tavallinen ja luultavasti herkullisin valmistustapa on hauduttaa nauriit sammuneen nuotion kuumaan hiillokseen haudattuina.;{};{};;;;;m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
