u_013_native_b7cd2adfcb945d96d1cc;component;exact;You want to follow me. Yes, you do.;Haluat seurata minua. Kyllä haluat.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_7fd46faceb66b0164aaa;component;exact;Can you catch me?;Saatko minut kiinni?;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_235e6d129cf2c8fbf807;component;exact;Come play with me.;Tule leikkimään kanssani.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_3c6f656e80a91f7c1065;component;exact;Catch me, and I'm yours.;Ota minut kiinni, niin olen sinun.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_69074562356a4ffefb35;component;exact;I have something for you.;Minulla on sinulle jotakin.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_e84a07f38a20cbcd77d8;component;exact;Come get what is now yours.;Tule hakemaan se, mikä on nyt sinun.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_c96a43f0176a0bca6e57;component;exact;Come, I want you to have it.;Tule, haluan antaa sen sinulle.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_4c2abc9ce11690b49f4f;component;exact;Follow me and get your gift.;Seuraa minua ja saat lahjasi.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_1feab8e9f103d65b61dc;component;exact;I won't do that! See, I've hurt myself enough already.;En tee sitä! Olen loukannut itseäni jo tarpeeksi.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_0f8340b86159bff346ea;component;exact;But we have a perfectly good fire already burning.;Meillähän palaa jo aivan hyvä tuli.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_fc04939e1494df6b0c0c;component;exact;I'm afraid I'm unable to light a proper fire here.;Pelkäänpä, etten voi sytyttää tänne kunnon nuotiota.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_8502b33f8a6f0a387ebe;component;exact;I will, as soon as you make sure I have proper equipment and we have proper trees around here.;Teen sen, kunhan varmistat, että minulla on oikeat varusteet ja täällä sopivia puita.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_feeb3f5d95408f7412f5;component;exact;Very well. I go fell some good, big trunks down.;Hyvä on. Menen kaatamaan kunnollisia, suuria runkoja.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_9f7d75b413cef63c5449;component;exact;I will, as soon as you make sure I have proper equipment and there are proper trunks around.;Teen sen, kunhan varmistat, että minulla on oikeat varusteet ja lähistöllä sopivia runkoja.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_59ede99ca077e834bf2b;component;exact;Very well. I'll start carving.;Hyvä on. Aloitan veistämisen.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_4169a1b1de3c30bfa63d;component;exact;Very well. I'll start splitting.;Hyvä on. Aloitan halkomisen.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_15741a6407d52aeb6973;component;exact;I will do my best.;Teen parhaani.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
u_013_native_4353c42309571310ee4f;component;exact;I'm afraid there is nothing butcher here. Bring me at a carcass if there is one.;Pelkäänpä, ettei täällä ole mitään teurastettavaa. Tuo minulle ruho, jos sellainen löytyy.;{};{};;;;{};m;;;;;1;finnish_translation;
